# (build 166) LANGUAGE changed while a message is being typed (lang_shop's
# store): the script copied again in the new language and typed again
# from its start -- its codes are the language's, and until 166 the rest
# of the old language's codes were typed in the new face (US English's in
# the Japanese one: nonsense kana). Then, finished, changed again: shown
# whole in the next language.
start building 5 13 5 18
wait idle
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait ticks 8
language ja
wait ticks 2
expect text "ラコニアスライサーだね。 だれが もつんだ?"
wait idle
shot 01_japanese
language retranslation
wait ticks 2
expect text "The Laconia Slicer, huh?"
shot 02_retranslated
